Welcome to TiePaper
✓ce off

TiePaper is a post-formatting word processor. You type plain text, and the layout is decided when you preview or print it. Lines that start with a checkmark (type a backslash) are instructions, like the margins and the header above this paragraph.

Words can be bold, underlined or italic; the little symbols you see while editing are the switches, and they never print. Press Ctrl+V to preview this page and F1 for every key.

✓ju off
Columns and sums

Item                      Qty        Price
Chairs                      4        12.50
Tables                     12        85.00
Lamps                       7         9.99

Numeric tabs line the numbers up on the decimal point. Set the column over the table with Ctrl+Shift+C,
sort it with Ctrl+Shift+A, or add it up with Ctrl+=.
